			"notes": "https://modrinth.com/mod/evil-beetroot/version/0.12.1\n\n# New Stuff\n- Added a new material: **Beetroot Diamond** craftable from a Diamond, Sentient Beetroot and Beetroot Heart\n- Added the classic tools made from Beetroot Diamonds: **Pickaxe**, **Axe**, **Shovel** and **Hoe**, which feed the player upon breaking blocks\n- Added three sword variants: **Dagger**, **Rapier**, **Claymore**, healing the player on hit with [Better Combat](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-combat) support\n## Updates\n- Made the Boss spawn in an area without solid blocks near the player instead of always spawning at the player's coordinates \n- Reduced Sentient Beetroot drop rates from the Boss"
		},
